      "index": 0,
      "text": "810, 972.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Align the Numbers by Place Value:**\n   ```\n     198,418\n   + 611,554\n   ----------\n   ```\n\n2. **Add the Ones Place:**\n   - **8 (from 198,418) + 4 (from 611,554) = 12**\n   - Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the tens place.\n\n3. **Add the Tens Place:**\n   - **1 (from 198,418) + 5 (from 611,554) + 1 (carried over) = 7**\n   - Write down **7**.\n\n4. **Add the Hundreds Place:**\n   - **4 (from 198,418) + 5 (from 611,554) = 9**\n   - Write down **9**.\n\n5. **Add the Thousands Place:**\n   - **8 (from 198,418) + 1 (from 611,554) = 9**\n   - Write down **9**.\n\n6. **Add the Ten Thousands Place:**\n   - **9 (from 198,418) + 1 (from 611,554) = 10**\n   - Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the hundred thousands place.\n\n7. **Add the Hundred Thousands Place:**\n   - **1 (from 198,418) + 6 (from 611,554) + 1 (carried over) = 8**\n   - Write down **8**.\n\n8. **Combine All the Results:**\n   ```\n     198,418\n   + 611,554\n   ----------\n     810,972\n   ```\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\boxed{810,\\!972}",
      "logprobs": null,
